sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant PR as Pull Request
    participant G1 as Gate 1: SAST
    participant G2 as Gate 2: IaC
    participant G3 as Gate 3: Deploy
    participant Prod as Production
    participant Audit as Audit Trail

    Dev->>PR: Push code changes
    PR->>G1: Trigger SAST + secrets scan
    G1->>G1: Semgrep custom rules (PII in logs)
    G1->>G1: TruffleHog (secrets detection)
    G1->>G1: PII pattern matching (Aadhaar, PAN)

    alt Gate 1 fails
        G1->>PR: Block merge + report violations
        G1->>Audit: Log finding (S.8(5) non-compliance)
    else Gate 1 passes
        G1->>G2: Trigger IaC policy check
    end

    G2->>G2: OPA/Rego: encryption at rest check
    G2->>G2: OPA/Rego: log retention >= 365 days
    G2->>G2: OPA/Rego: IAM least-privilege check

    alt Gate 2 fails
        G2->>PR: Block merge + report violations
        G2->>Audit: Log finding (Rule 6(1) non-compliance)
    else Gate 2 passes
        G2->>G3: Trigger deployment gate
    end

    G3->>G3: Erasure capability check (S.8(7))
    G3->>G3: Purpose binding validation (S.6(1))
    G3->>G3: Retention config check (Rule 8(1))

    alt Gate 3 fails
        G3->>PR: Block deploy + report violations
    else Gate 3 passes
        G3->>Prod: Deploy to production
        G3->>Audit: Generate compliance report
    end

    Audit->>Audit: Retain reports with logs for >= 1 year (Rules 6(1)(e), 8(3))
